OL,3,GNEWSAAutomated mobility scooters trial
OL,4,Ain Jersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople with disabilities can now hire a
OL,7,Fmobility scooter with their mobile
OL,8,Fphone before picking it up through an
OL,9,Fautomated system at Jersey's main
OL,10,Ftransport hub in St Helier.
OL,12,FThe trial, led by Shopmobility Jersey,
OL,13,Fis based at Liberation Station and
OL,14,Fallows users to book and pay for a
OL,15,Fscooter online before unlocking their
OL,16,Fvehicle with a secure code.
OL,18,FPreviously, scooters had to be
OL,19,Fcollected from the Shopmobility base on
OL,20,FSand Street. If successful, the trial
OL,21,Fcould be extended across the island.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
