OL,3,GNEWSAAutomated mobility scooters trial
OL,4,Ain Jersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdward Trevor MBE, founder and chairman
OL,7,Fof Shopmobility Jersey, said: "As far
OL,8,Fas I'm aware this is the first remote
OL,9,Fscheme in the British Isles."
